+- Browser scenario selects the attestation via its own data-testid hooks.
+  [`apply-form.yaml:124`](../../.claude/skills/bug-hunt/scenarios/landing/apply-form.yaml#L124)
+
+- Required-set contract + union classification admit the new radio.
+  [`apply-form-label-invariants.yaml:49`](../../.claude/skills/bug-hunt/scenarios/landing/apply-form-label-invariants.yaml#L49)
